WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.740
I'm Kurata Sana. A first year student at Jinbo middle school.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.070
Marvelous white bat, Babbit.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.750
Hayama Akito.

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.960
Matsui Fuka.
My Kansai dialect speaking best friend.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:51.840
Don't Believe in Rumors

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.560
Hasn't been in school
for 4 months

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.690
Sana-chan is very nervous.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.070
It'll be OK... for sure...

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.360
I'll talk to them normally.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.950
I've had enough time to prepare mentally.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:23.120
OK, ok.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:28.920
Kurata-san, you're late.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.000
Huh?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.300
It's Sana-chan!

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.550
Is it finished?
Yeah, it's over, over!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.010
Hey, Sana-chan came!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.970
Yeah, yeah, about this...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.230
Yo, Fuka!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.730
Sana, you're back!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.820
Long time no see.
When did you get back?

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:58.190
I came back during summer vacation.

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.820
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.320
Well... a lot of things came up...

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.370
Good, we can talk normally.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.160
It's true, it's Sana-chan!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.950
Hi, Tsuyoshi-kun, Aya-chan!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.460
Long time no see, Sana-chan.
How are you?

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.250
As usual, I'm feeling great!

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.380
It seems like I haven't seen you in ages!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.380
That's true!

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:21.300
Hayama...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:25.850
Keep cool, keep cool, keep cool, keep cool...

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.140
Yo.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.360
See, even Sana-chan is scared.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.780
It's surprising to see him like this, isn't it?

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:41.320
In the past 4 months,
he's grown 5 cm taller!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.360
5 cm in 4 months?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.660
He said he's a super growing machine.
At night, his body makes noises.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.250
Is that true?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.080
My bones hurt...

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.170
You're like an old man.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.170
Scary growing machine.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.960
Do you look up to me?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.960
As in "admire".

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:57.670
Huh?

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:58.380
Look up to me.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:03.050
Look up to... There's nothing to look up to, because there's nothing there at all.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:04.840
Why?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.980
Why did I just do that?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.690
The bell's ringing,
what's our next class?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.150
English, Aya-chan.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.150
Fuka...

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.780
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.740
...lend me your English dictionary.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.160
Again?! Buy your own!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.750
I'm going out with Fuka now.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.170
Ah! I have to use the toilet!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.170
I have to go before class starts! Toilet!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:40.170
- Toilet, toilet, toilet, toilet!
- You don't have to tell people about this.

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.460
Later!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.430
Toilet!

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.650
You're not supposed to step on the handle!

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:58.480
Wanna blame someone?
Have to blame the designer.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.320
School life is even more intense than work!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.030
Water washes away
an unhappy atmosphere

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.030
Don't waste water.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:12.870
The atmosphere already feels different from before.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:18.170
I didn't know that school could turn into such a stressful place.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.380
My heart is beating so fast...

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.670
...uneasiness...

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.180
...but it's OK, I can do it...

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.260
...because I am...

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:33.140
...the woman who amazed even circus lions with her amazing escape from the burning flames!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:38.150
Even "Yin Tian Tian Gong" would be impressed!

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.150
Who's "Yin Tian Tian Gong"?

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:42.860
Old gentleman magician

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.900
Escaped death from a car accident.

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:44.860
Let's go to class!

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.450
Kurata-san, long time no see.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.580
Hello, long time no see.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.740
Try to catch up on all the work.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.870
I guess school is a place to work hard too.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:01.170
My notebook is so empty.
I missed a lot.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.970
Sana, these are the notes I took for you.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.590
All of them?

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:11.680
I've written down all the important bits.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.640
Just memorize them and you'll be fine.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.640
Fuka.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.560
Fuka really is a good person.
I've got to be as nice to her as I was before.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.860
But I didn't ask you to do this for me.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.150
If I didn't notice minor details like this,
I'd really be an idiot.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.780
Or I wouldn't be your buddy.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:30.570
I'm not crying because of sadness...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.660
...I'm so happy.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.660
Really? Then come on, and start working hard.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.160
But...

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.750
You owe me 800 yen for the notebooks I bought for you...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.880
...and don't worry about the tax.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.380
You've worked out all the numbers... not willing to be taken advantage of!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.670
Fuka-chan.

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.760
What is it?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.760
It's my turn, help me with my work please.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.180
OK.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.680
Let me see Fuka-chan's notes.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:55.850
OK.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:58.140
Thank you.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.650
Wow... they're so neat.

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.270
I want them too. Let me copy them.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.440
Sana-chan.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.570
Fuka-chan is really smart...

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.070
In the final exam, she had the ninth highest mark in our grade.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.660
That's great!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.240
She's going to be our student rep next year...

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:15.660
And she's also good at PE.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:19.000
Yeah. I think she did very well in the local student competitions!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.250
In the assembly, the principal even gave her an award.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:27.960
Fuka is a really reliable, valuable person.
But I'm just a useless person.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.970
She's got a handsome boyfriend too!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.970
He's in Class 1, isn't he?
I'm so jealous of Fuka-chan.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.560
Handsome? Are they talking about him?

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:40.640
Better remember the notes here...

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.100
OK.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.400
It's Tsuyoshi-kun and the others.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.610
Should we go over there?

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.820
I don't know if there are any seats left there.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.160
Because Hayama is also there?

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.450
Say, Fuka...

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.410
Fuka... you and Hayama...

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.750
...are you two going out?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.540
Did someone tell you?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.960
Yeah, I was surprised.
What's going on then?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.460
We don't have to talk about that.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:13.380
Well, you've got to come to the team activity at least once. Can you come today?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:16.470
Yeah, all right then.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:19.060
Really? That's great!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:25.860
Fuka's deliberately not talking about Hayama.

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.730
I'm finished.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.150
Finished.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.440
All right, just leave them there.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.160
OK then.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:41.160
Sana, next term you're taking care of the flowers. Go find a vase for them.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.250
Why is that?
When did it turn out to be like this?

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.210
When I think about Fuka and I,

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:49.460
we became buddies because we're comfortable with each other.

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:53.170
But, we've only known each other for a month.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.680
So, it's not surprising that there's things I don't know about her.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.850
I wonder when she's going to tell me what's happening with Hayama.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.350
Sensei, you shouldn't run in the hall!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.770
Sorry, I'm in a hurry.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.270
Report to the principal's office,
on the double.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.280
Sorry. You weren't carrying the vase properly, were you?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.570
Can you go and help her?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.070
OK.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:18.240
I'm in a hurry, sorry.
Thank god, it's not broken.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.660
That scared me.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.660
Hey...

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.660
...what were you doing?

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:27.460
I'm in charge of the flowers.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.420
Your homeroom teacher is really good.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.550
He's a good teacher.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:38.340
My teacher isn't as good.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:41.470
The head of physics Sengoku-sensei?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.140
He looks pretty slimy.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:47.980
It's like seeing a rare animal...

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:51.360
...Hayama's actually doing what the teacher asked.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.150
He's changing on the inside.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:10:00.660
5 cm in 4 months, are you going to join the Giants baseball team?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.080
I would, if I could.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.080
Thank god, we can talk like how we used to.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.670
How can you wring out the towel like that?!

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:09.250
You've got to do it like...

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.670
...this.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.170
This?
<i>Confusing guy.</i>

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.170
I'm a pro at wringing out towels.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:17.840
From being at the dojo?
How's karate been lately?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.680
Lately?

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:24.560
I have more responsibilities...
it's more interesting than it was before.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.140
I see...

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.350
You...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.060
...when did you start wearing a bra?

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.480
What are you doing? Big pervert!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.690
Defense!

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.660
How dare you throw that on my face?!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.740
I haven't acted like this for so long.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.870
Can you really see my bra?
It's red with a floral pattern.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:50.040
You can't see it in an anime, sorry.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:54.960
I'd better change the color, or wear more clothes.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.970
Being a woman is so annoying.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.260
Sana, this...

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.340
You're still here!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.680
Give it back to Fuka.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.470
OK.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.850
Now.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.480
Wait a minute!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:11.350
What did you just say?!

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:14.650
I said, what did you just say?!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.650
What is isumomi?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.160
{parte b}

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:26.080
The answer is a bug-annoying person.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.450
I asked you what you just said!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.660
Give it back to Fuka.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.370
Before that!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.170
Sana, this...

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:36.170
Wh-Wh-What?!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.880
Why did you call me that?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.550
You're Sana, aren't you?
Or is it Samu?

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.180
My name is Samu.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.470
Honorifics are a big thing in Japan, so calling her by her given name without -chan signifies a certain level of intimacy/closeness.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.470
Why did you call me by my first name?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.850
Especially because up till now Hayama has always called her by her family name.

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:48.850
Oh, Fuka calls you that. Maybe it's rubbing off on me.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:54.480
That's right. Being together for a long time would affect the way they talk.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.270
Pretty soon, you'll start speaking with a Kansai accent.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:01.150
Not really.
We're not together that much.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.660
Anyway, you shouldn't call me by my first name...

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:08.870
...if it happens again, I'm going to seal your mouth with tape and throw you at the dentist!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.460
Why the dentist?

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.170
Why are you getting so mad?

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:20.970
When you get your adult teeth, you have to cherish them for the rest of your life.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:19.210
Naa...

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:23.550
You should be quiet in the washroom!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.680
Don't know why, but other people need to use it...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:29.180
...you have to keep quiet and clean.

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.270
I'm the only one getting so worked up.

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:34.140
- Just like an idiot!
- Sana-chan...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:38.070
...remember what your mom says...

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.440
Sana, enjoy yourself under adversity.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:47.160
Enjoy yourself under adversity.
Enjoy yourself under adversity...

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.870
Yes, Mama.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.080
I've got to stop being so stressed!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.870
It doesn't matter if the two of them are going out!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.170
I'll make fun of those two, those morons!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:01.380
Wait, you shouldn't step on the toilet handle!

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.260
For you, Fuka.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.550
What is it?

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.550
Hayama told me to give it to you.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.260
I bumped into him.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.760
Thanks.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.560
Say, Fuka-san...

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.850
...has Hayama kissed you?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:16.150
Why are you asking me this all of a sudden?

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:18.480
What's the matter?
Tell me, don't be shy.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.940
Why should I tell you?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:25.110
So he treasures you!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:31.740
That fool... in kindergarten, he did it when I didn't want him to.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:35.250
Is that so?
So you want him to kiss you now?

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.960
If you do, just move your face closer to him.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.040
Get close and he'll kiss you.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.550
Stick your chest out,
and he'll definitely touch it.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.760
Sana's going all out to make fun of her.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:47.340
How do you know this?

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.350
Fuka-chan's counter-attack!

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:50.970
A-about this...

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:55.640
I think all men are this simple, right?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.560
Managed to dodge it... really!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.440
You'd have to wait a million years before you can start talking about men.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.940
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:07.150
You're trying to analyze men, but you're inexperienced...

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.870
...you'd have to go out with every man in Japan before you can talk about them.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:11.950
In other words...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.660
...there isn't a woman on earth...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:15.750
..who can comment on men, as if she knows everything about them.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.670
So, stop talking about this stuff.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.250
She's got a sharp tongue.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:25.550
But it would probably be good...
if I put my face close to his.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.050
What?!

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.130
Dying

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.840
It's your own fault.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.850
Too much meddling only gives you more problems. Be careful.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.640
I've learned it.

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.060
After class.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.980
Sana, let's go to the group activities.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:41.060
I have to go, no matter what!
Activity! Activity!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.150
Why is she so excited?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.360
Let's exercise!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.280
I brought a new member.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:50.570
Hello, everyone.
I'm Kurata Sana, from Class 8.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.080
How do you feel after not being in school for so long?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.240
No problem at all!

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:59.460
I still get along with Fuka, and also joined a group activity.

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.170
Fuka really is perfect.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.460
She's so good!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.670
It's like she's a natural born gymnast...

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:11.340
...they say she placed third in competition.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:14.970
Can you do this?
I'm just like a clown...

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:20.140
...I'd fit in better in a circus.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.150
So...

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.560
...is everything normal in school now?

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.650
No problem...

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:28.150
- I hadn't been on the swing for 4 months!
- That's great.

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.150
I'm going to get prepared for tomorrow.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.700
- Strange...
- Strange?

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:38.450
That child has just begun a neverending act.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.080
Act?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.040
Not like in the movies or on TV...

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:47.460
...acting in real life... there is no way she can keep it up for long.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:50.170
Eventually, one's identity will be lost...

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.550
...if she keeps this up,
she'll destroy herself.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.850
Yes, hello?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.850
Sana-chan, it's Tsuyoshi.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.140
Hi, long time no talk!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.650
I wanted to ask you something.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.480
What is it?

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:08.650
Have you heard? About Akito-kun and Fuka-chan going out together?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.860
Yeah.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.780
What do you think?

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.360
I was a bit surprised but...

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.070
...it doesn't matter.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.160
Is that so... it doesn't matter?

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:21.460
Oh! Sorry, there's something I have to do.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.040
OK, see you tomorrow then.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.670
Sorry!

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:31.670
I'm so tired...

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:37.680
When I heard that Akito-kun and Fuka-chan were going out...

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.560
...I felt very lonely.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.350
Tsuyoshi-kun's flashback.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.980
Huh? With Fuka-chan?
Are you serious?

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.480
Why is it like this?
Who asked first?

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:52.150
She did.
She asked me if I'd like to be her boyfriend.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.450
I answered "fine with me".

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.660
"Fine with me"?

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:00.240
Yeah, because I felt like it then.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.160
Akito-kun, what about Sana-chan?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.750
I don't dislike Fuka.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.170
She's so slow.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:08.170
Think he's talking about Sana here.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:09.750
That's true.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.880
And she's got Kamura...
Forget about it.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.340
End of flashback.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:20.680
Back then, I was really surprised and lonely.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:25.350
Because I've been watching Akito-kun and Sana-chan grow up together since 6th grade...

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.980
...there's something between them...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:33.440
...an innocent emotion...

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:36.150
...but...

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.570
But what?

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.740
Ah, it's morning.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.740
Akito!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.750
Wait for me.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:48.380
You didn't button two of your buttons...
what a lousy dresser.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:49.380
Be quiet.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:53.170
Akito, be like Tsuyoshi-kun and just button them.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.840
Morning, Aya-chan!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.680
Morning, Sana-chan.
You're walking to school today?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.350
What are you doing?

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.270
Hayama knows he's wrong
but is still resisting.

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:04.640
That looks ugly...

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.980
Do you plan to stay like that all day?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:10.480
If you're going to bare your chest like that, why don't you go join SMAP?

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:10.480
SMAP = Jpop group

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.570
Why couldn't you have just done that from the beginning?

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.280
Are those two always like this?

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.950
Yeah, they are.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.450
That's so funny.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.740
Tell me about it!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:25.160
Sana, Aya-chan, don't just laugh.
You'll be late, if you don't hurry.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.370
Akito! Wait up!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.670
But... like this...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.670
...those two look good as a couple.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.760
When Sana is upside-down like this, she can't stop...

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.970
Like an unstoppable youth.

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:40.340
Sana-chan and Fuka-chan are good friends.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.760
- Going home already?
- I'm hungry.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.640
We all feel relaxed with each other...

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.350
...Sana-chan has Kamura-kun...

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.860
...I think this will turn out alright after all.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.570
Tsuyoshi-kun, how did you come to this conclusion?

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.150
Too late.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.280
Akito, you opened your button again.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.370
Akito likes to parade his superiority...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.740
...you should learn some obedience from Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.750
Right, Aya-chan?

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:09.870
Don't drag me into this.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:13.170
I feel as if there's a wall between us.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.880
Because both of you are couples...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.880
...I'm the only one who's single.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.050
What are you saying?

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.470
Sana, you're looking into things.

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:27.140
That's right.
Aren't you the one putting a wall up?

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.140
Here, here is a wall.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:34.940
You don't tell us anything.
We feel left out.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.650
Being an actress, maybe there's lots of things you can't talk about.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.860
Wait a sec, what do you mean?

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.950
Not again, you're still pretending...

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.160
...you aren't being honest enough.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:48.080
You've already made a love declaration with Kamura-kun.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:52.370
Sudden love declaration... I never heard about this...

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:58.050
That is...
did you all believe that it was true?

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.550
It's a lie!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.170
A lie? How?

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:05.680
But even if it is a lie, how come there are so many articles about it?

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:07.680
Yes, it's because...

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:12.140
...Rei-kun and Naozumi-kun's manager were both in the mountains...

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:17.150
...so they couldn't investigate it and false rumors were spread...

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:21.570
...if we were here, we definitely wouldn't have allowed it!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:27.240
Hey, did you all just assume that Naozumi-kun and I were going out together?

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:29.160
Don't you all remember?

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.160
There were lots of rumors like this before...

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.170
...how come you all believed them this time?

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.170
But...

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:40.050
...that thick eyebrow Ishida-kun said that's what you told him.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.840
Ishida?

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.550
Damn, I told him not to tell anyone...

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:50.850
That was because he was stalking me. I had to find an excuse.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.770
You didn't find out the truth from me...

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:58.150
...you all trusted the press and Ishida-kun instead, didn't you?

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.440
Sana-chan...

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.070
This...

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:04.650
But back then we had to believe it...

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:09.160
Frankly, you and Kamura-kun get along very well together, right?

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.450
Of course we get along well!
We're friends!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.080
And we couldn't get in touch with you either...

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:16.460
I couldn't do anything about that!
I was working in the mountains...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.880
Damn, my tears are coming out.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.460
Sana-chan...

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:25.760
Sorry, everyone. I'm going home now.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.180
- Sana-chan...
- Sana... Wait...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.430
Aki.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.850
My...

