00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.660
Let go!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:58.250
Is this worth getting upset over?

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.670
Enough! Mind your own business!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:02.880
That's no good, Sana.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:06.340
Sana...

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:10.350
D-didn't I tell you not to call me by my first name?!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:18.060
